  "Possible Issues", "ExampleSection",ExpressionUUID->
   "dda06a82-eb41-4b48-8510-6cb821647761"],
  $Line = 0; Null]], "ExampleSection",
 CellID->1305812373,ExpressionUUID->"9397dd0b-9de4-443a-9371-be2b75148f2f"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The result is a list of ",
 StyleBox["tuples",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 ", so a one-word identity returns a list of one-element lists rather than a \
list of words. Flatten before feeding them back if that matters."
}], "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"e0acb23e-7111-4324-90e2-4f820a9f668d"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

